@startuml SE_06_CheckIn
title Sequence Diagram: SE_06 Check-in phòng khám

actor "Bệnh nhân / Lễ tân" as User
participant "View\n(QRScannerActivity)" as View
participant "CheckInController" as Controller
participant "CheckInQueueService" as Service
participant "AppointmentRepository" as ApptRepo
participant "CheckInQueueRepository" as QueueRepo
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

User -> View: Quét QR hoặc nhập mã check-in
activate View
View -> Controller: processCheckIn(checkInRequest)
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: processCheckIn(appointmentId/code)
activate Service

Service -> ApptRepo: findByCode(code)
activate ApptRepo
ApptRepo -> DB: SELECT * FROM appointment WHERE code = ?
activate DB
DB --> ApptRepo: Appointment data (or null)
deactivate DB
ApptRepo --> Service: appointment
deactivate ApptRepo

alt Nếu mã không hợp lệ
    Service --> Controller: throw ResourceNotFoundException
    Controller --> View: Trả về lỗi 400 (Mã không hợp lệ)
    View --> User: Hiển thị thông báo lỗi
else Nếu hợp lệ
    Service -> Service: validateAppointmentTime(appointment)
    Service -> QueueRepo: findMaxQueueNumber(clinicRoomId)
    activate QueueRepo
    QueueRepo -> DB: SELECT MAX(queue_number) FROM check_in_queue WHERE room_id=?
    activate DB
    DB --> QueueRepo: currentMax
    deactivate DB
    QueueRepo --> Service: currentMax
    deactivate QueueRepo
    
    Service -> QueueRepo: save(CheckInQueue)
    activate QueueRepo
    QueueRepo -> DB: INSERT INTO check_in_queue...
    activate DB
    DB --> QueueRepo: success
    deactivate DB
    QueueRepo --> Service: queueEntity
    deactivate QueueRepo
    
    Service --> Controller: CheckInResponse(success, queueNumber)
    Controller --> View: 200 OK (CheckInResponse)
    View --> User: Check-in thành công, hiển thị số thứ tự
end

deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate View
@enduml
